   161	#
   162	# rc.1 re-pass round 3, part 3 — this used to remember the TOP-LEVEL component
   163	# and the sweep then ran `find <top> -type d -empty -delete` over the whole
   164	# tree. Removing one framework file under `docs/` therefore deleted every
