    48	#   security gate: a push that touches only those paths passes without
    49	#   review. The Grok twin ports the fine oracle with a fail-closed superset
    50	#   fallback; porting it here is a named item of the next release.
    51	#
    52	# ## Controls
    53	#
    54	# - `CEO_CODEX_PUSH_GATE=0`  -> disabled (no-op, exit 0).
    55	# - `CEO_CODEX_PUSH_GATE_ADVISORY=1` -> warn but do not block (exit 0).
