   266	  # dry-run preview, not after it. `--dry-run --restore README.md` used to
   267	  # print "would EXTRACT" and exit 0 for a file that is not a tarball —
   268	  # the help promises exit 4 for an invalid archive BEFORE the preview, and
   269	  # a preview that cannot fail is not a preview. The listing and the
   270	  # .claude-member check need nothing moved aside, so they run first; the
   271	  # rollback helper below tolerates an unset `aside` for exactly that.
   272	  _rst_rollback() {
