   196	# _framework_manifest_set.sh is REQUIRED (PLAN-183 W6). It has TWO consumers
   197	# here now: the orphan scan (framework-owned enumeration) and — since W6 — the
   198	# ONE validated reader of scripts/delivery-routes.tsv. doctor used to carry its
   199	# own copy of that parser; the copy WAS the defect (see the delivery-route
   200	# section below), so there is no longer anything to degrade to. Falling back to
   201	# identity resolution is D4 returning, and D4 does not merely misclassify: it
   202	# REPAIRS with the wrong bytes. Fail-closed to rc=2 (infra), mirroring the
   203	# _hash_lib.sh treatment above.
   204	if [ ! -f "$SCRIPT_DIR/_framework_manifest_set.sh" ]; then
